Package: sglasso
Type: Package
Title: Scaled Group Lasso
Version: 1.2.0
Date: 2026-10-07
Author: Bahadir Yuzbasi and Jiguo Cao
Maintainer: Bahadir Yuzbasi <b.yzb@hotmail.com>
Description: Implements the Scaled Group Lasso method for grouped regression
    with groupwise collinearity. Gaussian and binomial response families are
    supported. Binomial models use training-only groupwise Firth targets and
    an accelerated hybrid RcppArmadillo solver, with fold-local preprocessing
    and log-loss cross-validation.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5),
    Matrix
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.13)
Suggests:
    testthat,
    grpreg
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/byuzbasi/sglasso
BugReports: https://github.com/byuzbasi/sglasso/issues
LazyData: true
